1. Same firmware for both
2. Both have SRM for VMS/UNIX and Alphabios for NT
3. a =  designation for systems that could ship with options only supported
by NT, shipped with NT preinstalled.
    au= designation for systems that could only be shipped with options
compatible with VMS, UNIX and NT. Shipped with VMS or UNIX Factory
installed.

Elsa Gloria is supported by X on alpha linux..  permedia driver I beleive..
RH install will auto detect and install the driver for this card.


A note.. if their "a" make sure that you do not have a adaptec SCSI
controller, if you do you must use the alphabios console as SRM does not
support the adaptec (re "a" vs "au" )   or swap it for a Qlogic 1040b

JJ


